WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
- So you're very open about
everything in the documentary,

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.130
about your health, about
the highs and lows,

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.110
it's not like some depressing,
it's a lot of things

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.160
all the emotions,

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.470
but I thought that it was really
cool that you were so open

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:14.010
about, I mean, having lupus
about bipolar disorder,

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.780
about going to speak, what was that like

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:16.613
speaking at the hospital?
- That was amazing.

00:00:16.613 --> 00:00:18.420
I went to the McLean Hospital

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.570
and it's one of the
best hospitals for all,

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.850
I mean, they are, they're
kind of covering everything

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.020
in the mental health space.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:29.880
And so I was able to say
my diagnosis out loud

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:30.870
for the first time.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.130
And it just,
- Yeah.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.130
- it gave me such strength and it really,

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.620
it wasn't easy and I
think that's why I wanted

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.170
the documentary to feel really personal.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:44.160
But I'm kind of scared, like
a lot of people are gonna see

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:48.060
this whole other side of me and
I'm like, hope they like it.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.010
- I think it's refreshing.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:53.010
I think it's nice 'cause
it's such a filtered world.

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.480
Like and we're different generations

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.940
so it's just like, it's I feel
like your age and younger,

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.890
like, it's just such a different world

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.540
where everybody filters everything online

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:01.680
and and that's not life.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:02.520
That's not real life.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.080
Like everybody has things,

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:04.913
right?
- Yes.

00:01:04.913 --> 00:01:06.630
- And I just thought it was very powerful

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.090
like to not know what
was happening with you,

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.440
but you knew something was wrong.

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.450
You sought out help and you got it.

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:15.810
And that's gonna help so
many people that watch this.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:16.643
I hope so.

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:17.476
- Yes.

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:20.730
Whether it's depression or
whatever, anxiety, like whatever.

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:21.780
It's like it really does.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.360
You watch it and you go, okay
wait, I do vibe with that.

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:25.290
Like, that's similar to me.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:27.960
So it's, it's gonna, I think,
awaken a lot of people.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.753
- I hope so 'cause I'm really nervous.

